      "review_description": "The quoting process with Sean was great and very knowledgeable. Provided several options and answered all my questions. The in-house installer Tyler came onsite to check location before quote finalisation.Sean was great with communication with unexpected delays as our install got caught up with supply issues because EOF the new battery rebate.Unfortunately I had specifically requested a few panels on west side and on the day they were not installed & instead added to our east string (due to not being enough voltage to trigger the string), Tyler did not mention it during install and I only noticed when I looked at the roof the next day.  This was our only disappointment in regards to communications, we were shown voltage results on why west string wasn't viable so it was really just a limitation with the system.Took an extra visit to get the monitoring working correctly, but it was a quick & simple.",
